\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces Inspectable-bottleneck pipeline for NPC dialogue generation. A LoRA-adapted Qwen3-4B latent predictor encodes raw dialogue context and the NPC profile; 29 supervised classification heads expose a structured social-state vector $\hat  {Z}_t$ spanning intent, affect, motivation, relations, norms, and decision policy. The exposed state drives a fast/slow router and disclosure constraints before final response generation, making the full pipeline inspectable.}}{4}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{fig:pipeline}{{1}{4}{Inspectable-bottleneck pipeline for NPC dialogue generation. A LoRA-adapted Qwen3-4B latent predictor encodes raw dialogue context and the NPC profile; 29 supervised classification heads expose a structured social-state vector $\hat {Z}_t$ spanning intent, affect, motivation, relations, norms, and decision policy. The exposed state drives a fast/slow router and disclosure constraints before final response generation, making the full pipeline inspectable}{figure.caption.5}{}}
